	(text "BTT6050-1ERA channel (PROFET+24V). Values from datasheet Rev 1.00 application BOM:\nRIN = RDEN = RSENSE = 10k, CSENSE 100 pF, COUT 10 nF, CVS 100 nF, ZGND = resistor + diode (22R + DSK16).\nIS: I_IS = I_L / kILIS (~1500); RIS 680R -> ~0.45 V/A at the ADC; fault current 6-40 mA -> clamped to 3V3.\nCurrent limit is internal (38-56 A): wiring must be fused; firmware adds a programmable soft fuse.\nCooling tab = VS: connect to a large VS copper area on both layers (shared by all channels)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b9dff0c3-9b6f-43e9-acab-92aea7c0ad50")
	)
